It's easy to do (in Perl) if you maintain a list of games you've seen;
the first entry is a unique identifier for a game (I believe it
consists of server number and game number). Here's something I might
write for parsing the tourneys' xlogfiles (and indeed, I've written
something very similar, though a little more censored-swear-wordy :))

while ($line = <>)
{
  $line =~ s/^(\S+) //;
  next if $seen{$1}++;
  # process $line
}

